      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OLD FRIENDS (3) was a most impressive winner to make it two in a row at this track over 388m (22.15). Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. In great recent form and expected to measure up again. EXCESSIVE WHEELS (1) hit the frame two back then broke through last time by 1.5 lengths (22.51) at this track over 388m. Nicely drawn here. Can measure up again. STEREOPHONIC (7) is better than last start when fifth (30.48) in a Grade 5 at this track over 515m. Has never been out of the money in three starts this distance. Expected to feature in the finish. EXCITING FORTE (2) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
